---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith("/") ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL : import.meta.env.BASE_URL + "/";
---
<Layout>
  <div class="wrap">
    <section>
      <div class="tagline" style="font-size:20px; color:#111; max-width:640px;">
        Solutions Consultant at Dassault Systèmes — I build the data pipelines and models, then
        translate them into decisions executives act on.
      </div>
      <p class="blurb" style="margin-top:16px; max-width:640px;">
        I currently partner with Fortune 500 engineering organizations — Boeing, NVIDIA, and Ford —
        to scope and ship analytics platforms. Before that: forecasting models for early-stage VC,
        credit-risk models for underserved borrowers, and a reinforcement-learning benchmarking study
        comparing human and machine behavior. Outside of work, I'm a tenor saxophonist, jazz
        bandleader, and I build small data-driven side projects for fun.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="home-section-head">
        <h2 class="section-title">Experience</h2>
        <a class="read-more" href={base + "experience/"}>Full history &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="entry">
        <div class="entry-head">
          <div><span class="entry-role">Solutions Consultant</span> <span class="entry-org">· Dassault Systèmes</span></div>
          <div class="entry-date">Jul 2024 – Present</div>
        </div>
        <p class="meta-line">Embedded with Boeing, NVIDIA, and Ford — license-utilization analytics, CI/CD automation, and a company-wide pitch win for a Humanoid Robotics integration strategy.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="entry">
        <div class="entry-head">
          <div><span class="entry-role">Data Analyst Intern</span> <span class="entry-org">· Modern Venture Partners</span></div>
          <div class="entry-date">Nov 2022 – Jun 2023</div>
        </div>
        <p class="meta-line">PyTorch RNN forecasting funding trends across 2,000+ startups; SQL ETL over 900,000+ investment records.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="entry">
        <div class="entry-head">
          <div><span class="entry-role">ML Research Assistant</span> <span class="entry-org">· W.M. Keck Science Center</span></div>
          <div class="entry-date">May – Aug 2023</div>
        </div>
        <p class="meta-line">Benchmarked RL agents against 10,000+ human players; presented at a symposium in Rhodes, Greece.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="entry">
        <div class="entry-head">
          <div><span class="entry-role">Data Analyst Intern</span> <span class="entry-org">· Level Goals</span></div>
          <div class="entry-date">May – Aug 2022</div>
        </div>
        <p class="meta-line">Credit-score-free risk model for underserved borrowers; 8 executive-facing dashboards.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="home-section-head">
        <h2 class="section-title">Projects &amp; Research</h2>
        <a class="read-more" href={base + "projects/"}>Read more &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="project-card">
        <div class="project-title"><span>Mizen</span><span class="project-date">Winter 2025</span></div>
        <p class="project-desc">Dual-layer RAG pipeline normalizing recipe data from 1,000+ live sources. In production at <a href="https://mizen.recipes" target="_blank" rel="noopener">mizen.recipes</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="project-card">
        <div class="project-title"><span>Growth-Ring Audio Signatures</span><span class="project-date">Ongoing</span></div>
        <p class="project-desc">Turning musical performances into visual "signatures" — timbral features rendered as concentric growth rings.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="project-card">
        <div class="project-title"><span>Medley Vox</span><span class="project-date">Fall 2023</span></div>
        <p class="project-desc">RNN model for multi-singer detection and speaker diarization using SpeechBrain embeddings.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="blurb" style="margin-top:16px;">
        On the research side: my senior thesis and Hexxed work compared how humans and
        reinforcement-learning agents learn complex skills — humans learn in non-linear leaps, stubbornly
        test bad strategies, and artificially narrow their own options; agents don't. I'm continuing that
        thread as a Research Collaborator with the Allen Institute's Mihalas Lab, and extending the
        underlying question into how AI systems should be designed to preserve, rather than erode, human
        cognitive agency.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="home-section-head">
        <h2 class="section-title">Education</h2>
        <a class="read-more" href={base + "education/"}>Details &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <dl class="skills-grid">
        <dt>Pomona College</dt>
        <dd>B.A. Computer Science, May 2024 — GPA 3.7 (Data Science 3.9)</dd>
        <dt>Study Abroad</dt>
        <dd>Aquincum Institute of Technology, Budapest — Deep Learning, Spring 2023</dd>
        <dt>Neuromatch Academy</dt>
        <dd>NeuroAI intensive, July 2026</dd>
        <dt>RLCIE Fellow</dt>
        <dd>Randall Lewis Center for Innovation &amp; Entrepreneurship, Claremont McKenna College</dd>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="home-section-head">
        <h2 class="section-title">Origins</h2>
        <a class="read-more" href={base + "origins/"}>The longer story &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <p class="blurb">
        Before data and ML, there was civic work and teaching: a youth seat on Bellevue's City Hall
        Youth Link Council, the Bank of America National Civic Leadership Program, four years teaching
        aerospace concepts to kids at the Museum of Flight, and running a business-development role
        for a college innovation center. I'm also a tenor saxophonist and jazz bandleader — Reading
        Days, Seattle JazzED, and a high school jazz ensemble before that.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="section-title">Contact</h2>
      <div class="contact-links">
        <a href="mailto:rjaa2024@gmail.com">Email</a>
        <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/rahulj24" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/rjaa2020" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
